+Both new scans passed the exact-member, validator, byte-range, length, CRC-32 and SHA-256 checks. Both prior comparison PDFs matched their stored hashes. All new text pages were screened. The chart fields and selected operator header and body regions were checked on renders. The documentary verifier compared literal labels and generated distinct SHA-256 values for the two p. 36 grayscale renders at 96 dpi. Its first run stopped on an indented footer and the second accepted only surrounding horizontal whitespace. This measured document structure and copy differences. No live or historical call, switch or audio test was performed. [Source pins and test output](SOURCE-PINS.json)
